I'm sorry, I just wanted to close myself off

777
00:50:00,470 --> 00:50:02,920
才装作有事的
from the possibility of being rejected.

778
00:50:04,340 --> 00:50:05,550
没事
That's no problem.

779
00:50:07,020 --> 00:50:08,620
- 我去拿助燃油 - 好
- I'll get the lighter fluid. - Okay.

780
00:50:08,640 --> 00:50:10,200
屋里暖和 进来坐坐？
Do you wanna come inside while I look?

781
00:50:10,220 --> 00:50:12,400
算了 想在这儿等 行吗？
Uh, no, sorry. Can I wait outside?

782
00:50:12,430 --> 00:50:15,940
行 没问题 我马上给你
Yeah. Don't worry about it. Um, I'll be back soon.

783
00:50:27,940 --> 00:50:29,360
这该够用
This should do the trick.

784
00:50:30,580 --> 00:50:31,740
太好了 谢谢
Great, thanks.

785
00:50:31,760 --> 00:50:36,430
倒在要烧的东西上 就行了吧？
And so do I just pour this on the thing I want to be on fire?

786
00:50:36,450 --> 00:50:39,180
烧什么 烧烤吗？
On the barbecue?

787
00:50:39,760 --> 00:50:40,770
对
Yes.

788
00:50:40,790 --> 00:50:44,430
呃 嗯 别倒太多
Uh, yeah, don't put too much of it on there.

789
00:50:45,380 --> 00:50:46,590
好
Okay.

790
00:50:46,850 --> 00:50:48,950
要 要我帮忙吗？
Do you... do you want my help?

791
00:50:48,970 --> 00:50:50,180
不用
No.

792
00:50:51,780 --> 00:50:53,110
谢谢你...
Thank you...

793
00:50:53,290 --> 00:50:54,160
是盖文
Gavin.

794
00:50:54,190 --> 00:50:58,220
对 盖文 真谢谢你 盖文
Gavin. Yes. Thank you, definitely, Gavin.

795
00:51:00,830 --> 00:51:02,540
你不是住那边吗？
Uh, don't you live over there?

796
00:51:02,560 --> 00:51:05,580
啥 哦 对 确实是 哈哈
Ha! Yup, I... yup, definitely. Oops.

797
00:51:15,370 --> 00:51:17,500
{\an1}（《乔凡尼的房间》）

798
00:51:15,370 --> 00:51:22,670
{\an9}【《乔凡尼的房间》：詹姆斯·鲍德温（美）所著小说 聚焦同性恋身份与孤独】

799
00:51:35,090 --> 00:51:36,970
从哪儿弄的？
Why do you have that?

800
00:51:37,360 --> 00:51:39,330
找邻居要的
I got it from the neighbor.

801
00:51:40,430 --> 00:51:41,810
干嘛要？
Why?

802
00:51:41,930 --> 00:51:45,460
肯定不是正常人会有的想法
It's definitely not, like, a good or normal train of thought.

803
00:51:46,020 --> 00:51:47,520
好
Okay.

804
00:51:47,990 --> 00:51:51,740
我本来想把德克尔办公室烧掉
I think I was gonna light Decker's office on fire.

805
00:51:55,960 --> 00:51:57,120
好
Okay...

806
00:51:59,210 --> 00:52:01,750
你真想这么做吗
Do you still wanna do it?

807
00:52:02,250 --> 00:52:03,610
没想好
I don't know.

808
00:52:08,060 --> 00:52:09,680
那我来做
I will do it.

809
00:52:10,750 --> 00:52:13,020
你真好
That's really nice.

810
00:52:14,930 --> 00:52:16,150
但不用
But no.

811
00:52:16,180 --> 00:52:19,790
认真说 要是你想烧他办公室
No, seriously. If you need someone to burn his office down,

812
00:52:19,810 --> 00:52:23,260
又不想自己去 我替你做
but you don't wanna do it yourself, I will do it.

813
00:52:23,290 --> 00:52:26,480
不 我甚至不想咒他死
No, I don't even want him to die.

814
00:52:26,590 --> 00:52:27,980
我想
I do.

815
00:52:29,650 --> 00:52:31,810
我不想他死
I don't want him to die.

816
00:52:33,150 --> 00:52:35,610
好吧 改主意了就告诉我
Well, if you change your mind...

817
00:52:35,650 --> 00:52:36,990
谢谢
Thanks.

818
00:52:39,680 --> 00:52:42,060
也许一起烧点小的
Maybe we could burn something smaller,

819
00:52:42,080 --> 00:52:45,420
他头发或他笔之类的
like his hair or his pens or something.

820
00:52:45,740 --> 00:52:47,340
我会考虑的
I'll think about that.

821
00:52:48,670 --> 00:52:49,800
好
Okay.

822
00:52:54,090 --> 00:52:57,100
哎 还得去做烤肠
I have to make hot dogs.

823
00:52:57,130 --> 00:52:58,330
为嘛？
Oh, why?

824
00:52:58,360 --> 00:53:02,840
我跟邻居编了大谎 不烤心里过不去
I told the neighbor, it's like this whole big lie. I'm stuck in a lie.

825
00:53:02,860 --> 00:53:04,910
好 我来做
Okay. I will do it.

826
00:53:04,940 --> 00:53:06,430
对不起
I'm sorry.

827
00:53:06,460 --> 00:53:09,900
没事 我本想砍个人 相比这小菜一碟
No, it's fine. I was gonna, like, kill a man, so this is much easier.

828
00:53:09,930 --> 00:53:13,040
家里有烤肠吗？
Do we have hot dogs?

829
00:53:14,210 --> 00:53:16,020
不知道
I don't know.

830
00:54:30,610 --> 00:54:31,650
嗨
Hi.

831
