好 我要去买咖啡
Okay. I'm going to get coffee.

832
00:54:44,670 --> 00:54:46,800
我能抱你吗？
Do you want me to pick you up?

833
00:54:55,940 --> 00:54:58,150
哦 天呐
Well, fuck.

834
00:54:58,540 --> 00:55:01,840
太美好了
This is really nice.

835
00:55:03,400 --> 00:55:04,880
我想...
I guess um...

836
00:55:05,700 --> 00:55:08,050
对 我爱你
Yup. I love you.

837
00:55:12,690 --> 00:55:15,230
愿意陪我买咖啡吗？
You wanna come get coffee?

838
00:55:15,950 --> 00:55:17,880
三文鱼罐头？
Salmon.

839
00:55:18,450 --> 00:55:22,490
好吧 挺挑食的 有品位
All right, you're picky, an excellent quality.

840
00:55:22,540 --> 00:55:23,830
金枪鱼的？
Tuna.

841
00:55:25,950 --> 00:55:28,290
可能隔着罐头闻不出来
Maybe you're just smelling the can.

842
00:55:28,310 --> 00:55:30,290
里面是金枪鱼
There's tuna inside.

843
00:55:30,760 --> 00:55:33,040
好 各买一罐
All right, one of each.

844
00:55:49,440 --> 00:55:50,560
嗨
Hey.

845
00:55:51,570 --> 00:55:52,980
就这些吗？
Is this all for you today?

846
00:55:53,010 --> 00:55:54,710
