879
01:00:34,740 --> 01:00:35,570
明白
Yes.

880
01:00:35,600 --> 01:00:37,640
要达到不怀疑的标准
That to be convinced beyond a shadow of a doubt,

881
01:00:37,660 --> 01:00:40,470
在案发时非得亲眼见到吗？
you must have been there and seen the crime with your own eyes?

882
01:00:40,500 --> 01:00:41,960
不用 明白
