937
01:03:06,200 --> 01:03:10,380
谢谢你问 我是个教授
So, thank you for asking. I am actually a professor,

938
01:03:11,000 --> 01:03:13,900
还没转正 期待早日实现
part-time, hopefully soon full-time,

939
01:03:13,920 --> 01:03:15,860
教书很重要
which, teaching is important work.

940
01:03:15,880 --> 01:03:18,090
教学是很有意义的
I think teaching is important.

941
01:03:18,120 --> 01:03:22,260
有人说教师是最合适的陪审员
Some would say that a teacher makes an ideal juror.

942
01:03:22,290 --> 01:03:24,540
才不是呢 不
Absolutely not, no.

943
01:03:24,560 --> 01:03:26,370
你的问卷表上写着...
On your questionnaire, you wrote...

944
01:03:26,390 --> 01:03:27,450
哦 别 别
Oh, no, no.

945
01:03:27,480 --> 01:03:30,350
我没想到会被当众念出来
I did not know that we would be reading those aloud, so.

946
01:03:30,380 --> 01:03:32,270
“你朋友怎样形容你”
"How would your friends describe you?"

947
01:03:32,300 --> 01:03:36,010
“聪明”被划掉了 改成了个“高”
"Smart." Crossed out, then the word "tall."

948
01:03:38,980 --> 01:03:43,390
要是那遭遇让你有偏见 就会免除你
If the crime you were a victim of makes you biased, we will dismiss you.

949
01:03:45,200 --> 01:03:46,770
说了不会惹上事吧？
Can I get in trouble for telling you?

950
01:03:46,790 --> 01:03:49,120
你是受害者 怎会有事？
Why would you get in trouble if you were the victim?

951
01:03:49,150 --> 01:03:50,440
我不知道
I don't know.

952
01:03:50,460 --> 01:03:53,620
法律有很多不讲理的地方
The law makes no sense in my opinion.

953
01:03:58,460 --> 01:03:59,460
那...
I...

954
01:04:02,890 --> 01:04:06,100
那事我从未公开说过
I haven't said it out loud actually before.

955
01:04:06,130 --> 01:04:07,670
没关系的
Well, that's okay.

956
01:04:07,870 --> 01:04:09,490
你报警了吗？
Did you go to the police?

957
01:04:10,440 --> 01:04:11,530
没有
No.

958
01:04:11,730 --> 01:04:14,300
物证只有个扣子
All I had was a button,

959
01:04:14,330 --> 01:04:17,110
我也不想见他坐牢
and I don't want him to go to jail.

960
