哦 真的吗
Oh, really, does that happen?

1348
01:30:00,500 --> 01:30:02,470
因为我的脸吗？ 呵呵
Is it my face?

1349
01:30:05,860 --> 01:30:07,650
因为我的脸吗？
Hello, is it my face?

1350
01:30:30,010 --> 01:30:31,200
灯塔游！
Lighthouse day!

1351
01:30:31,220 --> 01:30:32,310
灯塔游
Lighthouse day.

1352
01:30:32,340 --> 01:30:35,060
弗兰 弗兰 灯塔游！
Fran. Fran. Lighthouse day!

1353
01:30:35,090 --> 01:30:36,340
灯塔游
Lighthouse day.

1354
01:30:36,470 --> 01:30:38,580
简妮 简妮 灯塔游！
Janie, Janie. Lighthouse day!

1355
01:30:38,600 --> 01:30:41,040
她昨晚没怎么睡 你懂的
She actually didn't sleep super well, so.

1356
01:30:41,060 --> 01:30:41,460
哦
Oh.

1357
01:30:41,480 --> 01:30:44,290
是啊 我们真的 真的筋疲力尽
Yeah, we're really, really fucking tired.

1358
01:30:44,450 --> 01:30:47,620
她今天不太适合大活动
Yeah, I don't think she's gonna be in for, like, a big thing today.

1359
01:30:47,640 --> 01:30:48,800
说宝宝吗？
The baby?

1360
01:30:48,820 --> 01:30:51,860
她只是个小宝宝 应该没问题
Well, she's just a baby, she could do whatever.

1361
01:30:52,090 --> 01:30:53,590
其实不见得
I mean, not really.

1362
01:30:54,160 --> 01:30:56,280
你们俩去吧 我留下来
But you two go. I will stay here.

1363
01:30:56,310 --> 01:30:57,650
真的？行
Oh, really? Okay.

1364
01:30:57,700 --> 01:30:59,480
我真想让你也看看
I really wanted you to see it.

1365
01:30:59,500 --> 01:31:02,170
宝贝 会有机会的 放心
Babe, I will see it at some point. It's okay.

1366
01:31:02,960 --> 01:31:04,390
好吧
Okay.

1367
01:31:09,640 --> 01:31:10,800
别
No.

1368
01:31:11,460 --> 01:31:13,760
不 你俩都去
No, you two go.

1369
01:31:13,850 --> 01:31:16,660
不行 总得有人陪简
No, no, someone has to stay with Jane.

1370
01:31:17,140 --> 01:31:18,350
我来
I'll do it.

1371
01:31:20,410 --> 01:31:22,120
你确定？
Really?

1372
01:31:22,300 --> 01:31:24,800
哦 简比较难伺候
Oh, Jane is actually really particular.

1373
01:31:24,910 --> 01:31:26,500
交给我吧
I will do it.

1374
01:31:29,660 --> 01:31:32,030
天呐 安尼丝 太谢谢你了
Oh, my God. Agnes, thank you so much.

1375
01:31:32,060 --> 01:31:34,460
弗兰 我们自由了！自由了！
Fran, we're free! We're free.

1376
01:31:35,230 --> 01:31:36,480
灯塔很浪漫的
The lighthouse is very romantic.

1377
01:31:36,500 --> 01:31:38,390
就该你俩去
You two should be there alone together.

1378
01:31:38,410 --> 01:31:40,830
再造个宝宝什么的
Make another baby or whatever.

1379
01:31:40,850 --> 01:31:43,090
就二十分钟 很快的
Like, twenty minutes, that's it.

1380
01:31:43,110 --> 01:31:45,830
问一下 她会不会把我吃了？
One question. What if she kills me?

1381
01:31:45,850 --> 01:31:47,710
她不吃人
She's not gonna kill you.

1382
01:31:55,060 --> 01:31:56,100
嘿...
Hey...

1383
01:31:57,390 --> 01:31:59,400
别抱掉了
Don't drop her.

1384
01:32:00,220 --> 01:32:02,670
不会 我抱不掉的
No. I won't drop her.

1385
01:32:07,530 --> 01:32:08,650
好...
Okay...

1386
01:32:09,670 --> 01:32:10,920
好了
Okay.

1387
01:32:11,740 --> 01:32:12,740
好的
Okay.

1388
01:32:14,410 --> 01:32:15,540
谢谢
Thank you.

1389
01:32:16,910 --> 01:32:18,690
给你小兔兔
Here you go.

1390
01:32:19,660 --> 01:32:21,160
太谢谢了
Thank you.

1391
01:32:22,180 --> 01:32:23,830
- 给你 宝贝 - 谢谢
- Here you go, babe. - Thank you.

1392
01:32:23,880 --> 01:32:24,880
利迪？
Lydie?

1393
01:32:25,310 --> 01:32:26,480
嗯？
Yeah?

1394
01:32:27,210 --> 01:32:29,140
我该对她说点啥？
What do I say to her?

1395
01:32:29,160 --> 01:32:31,250
宝贝 什么都不用说
Babe, you don't have to say anything.

1396
01:32:31,470 --> 01:32:32,980
就二十分钟
Twenty minutes.

1397
01:33:05,130 --> 01:33:06,200
嗨
Hi.

1398
01:33:07,080 --> 01:33:08,360
我是安尼丝
I'm Agnes.

1399
01:33:11,260 --> 01:33:16,210
真神奇 最终你会长成个独立的人
Pretty weird you're gonna be a person someday.

1400
01:33:16,230 --> 01:33:18,580
别介意 你现在真有点吓人
No offense, but you look insane right now.

1401
01:33:18,600 --> 01:33:21,420
光溜溜 头发很少
Skin and just a small amount of hair.

1402
01:33:22,710 --> 01:33:24,120
别担心
Don't worry.

1403
01:33:25,110 --> 01:33:26,940
很快会变样的
It won't be like that in a little.

1404
01:33:33,000 --> 01:33:35,830
能抱抱你吗？
Is this okay or...

1405
01:33:49,520 --> 01:33:50,730
行
All right.

1406
01:33:51,880 --> 01:33:53,440
不抱了
I'll put you down.

1407
01:33:53,470 --> 01:33:55,590
想要啊 那就再抱起来
Oh. I'll pick you back up.

1408
01:33:55,610 --> 01:33:57,120
抱了 抱了 抱了
Okay, okay, okay.

1409
01:34:22,250 --> 01:34:23,860
你长得真漂亮
You're so sweet looking.

1410
01:34:39,210 --> 01:34:43,910
等你长大后 不管什么想法...
When you grow up, you can tell me whatever.

1411
01:34:44,810 --> 01:34:49,700
都可以告诉我 哪怕是个坏念头
Like, if you have a thought and you're like, that's a bad thought,

1412
01:34:50,860 --> 01:34:55,280
我很可能也有过 而且更坏
I probably had that same thought but, like, ten times worse.

1413
01:34:57,200 --> 01:34:59,580
所以你尽管说
So you can just tell me.

1414
01:35:00,230 --> 01:35:03,310
我不会大惊小怪的
I'll never be scared by that.

1415
01:35:07,710 --> 01:35:11,090
要是有人对你做了桩噩事...
If someone does something bad to you...

1416
01:35:11,190 --> 01:35:14,550
有人借此闲言碎语 冷嘲热讽...
If someone says something scary...

1417
01:35:16,150 --> 01:35:21,740
让你想用铅笔 刀之类的东西自尽
If you wanna kill yourself with like a pencil or a knife or whatever,

1418
01:35:23,470 --> 01:35:25,870
都可以跟我说
you can just tell me.

1419
01:35:28,730 --> 01:35:33,300
我永远不会评头论足 大惊小怪
I'll never tell you you're scaring me.

1420
01:35:33,340 --> 01:35:36,900
我只会说 嗯 我知道...
I'll just say, yeah. I know.

1421
01:35:37,690 --> 01:35:40,820
事情有时就这样
It's just like that sometimes.

1422
01:35:40,850 --> 01:35:41,940
嗯
Yeah.

1423
01:35:45,620 --> 01:35:46,800
对不起
I'm sorry

1424
01:35:47,830 --> 01:35:50,570
坏事可能会找上你
that bad things are gonna happen to you.

1425
01:35:52,790 --> 01:35:54,960
希望不会
I hope they don't.

1426
01:35:55,270 --> 01:35:58,750
要是我能阻止 一定要跟我说
If I can ever stop something from being bad, let me know.

1427
01:36:01,410 --> 01:36:04,900
坏事不会给你打招呼
But sometimes bad stuff just happens.

1428
01:36:07,460 --> 01:36:10,010
所以我有点心疼你
That's why I feel bad for you,

1429
01:36:10,040 --> 01:36:11,290
某种程度上
in a way.

1430
01:36:13,060 --> 01:36:19,330
你活着却还体会不到
That you're alive and you don't know that yet.

1431
01:36:25,790 --> 01:36:29,150
但我还是能静心聆听的
But I can still listen

1432
01:36:29,170 --> 01:36:31,360
不会大惊小怪
and not be scared.

1433
01:36:35,640 --> 01:36:37,260
这很好
So that's good.

1434
01:36:39,010 --> 01:36:42,080
至少是点儿安慰
Or that's something, at least.

